This is a simple one to install:

At the BEGINNING of line #67, of BBStext, (The command line for the MAIN
prompt), add the following MCI command:

\#0pfiles:Oneliner.rexx\

Change line 105 to read as the following:

\n1\=1\#0pfiles:Onelinerwrite.rexx\

Be sure to change the path within the programs if you keep the files "Lines"
and "Nlines" in a different directory than PFILES: . You should be all set.

Be sure to look thru the onliner files provided, delete any you don't like,
and make sure that if you do so, change the number in Nlines appropriately.

